# Privacy Policy

**The short version:** this website collects nothing about you.

Sidestage Presents runs a simple static website. There are no user accounts, no comment forms, no newsletters, and no tracking cookies. We do not collect, store, or share any personal information through this site, and we run no analytics that identify visitors.

**Ticket links.** Show listings link out to third-party ticket sellers (such as Ticketmaster, TicketWeb, and Eventbrite). Those sites have their own privacy policies and data practices, which we do not control.

**Site editing.** The site's content editor (/admin) signs in with GitHub through Decap CMS. That login is only for authorized site editors managing content — it is not a visitor account system and collects nothing from the public.

**Contact.** If you have questions about this policy, reach us on Instagram at [@SidestagePresents](https://www.instagram.com/sidestagepresents/).

*Last updated: October 2026.*
